215","x-rspamd-action":"216","x-rspamd-server":"217"},"<html>\\n<head>\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=Windows-1252\\">\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<style type=\\"text/css\\" style=\\"display:none;\\"><!-- P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} --></style>\\n<div id=\\"divtagdefaultwrapper\\" style=\\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;\\" dir=\\"ltr\\">\\n<p>Hello Val ça va?</p>\\n<p><br>\\n</p>\\n<p>Pas de soucis la personne qui s'occupe de Leaman va te faire un retour rapide sur ta demande.</p>\\n<p><br>\\n</p>\\n<p>As tu pu contacter Victor à propos de la formation?</p>\\n<p><br>\\n</p>\\n<p>A bientôt !</p>\\n<p><br>\\n</p>\\n<div id=\\"Signature\\">\\n<div id=\\"divtagdefaultwrapper\\" dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, EmojiFont, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, NotoColorEmoji, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Android Emoji&quot;, EmojiSymbols; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<p><strong><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,111,201)\\">Boudon Edward</span></strong></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><strong>Responsable Valréas / Vaison-La-Romaine<br>\\n</strong></span><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><strong><span style=\\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\\">Société BJ Distribution</span></strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><strong>04 90 37 38 38</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><strong>boudonedward@bjdistribution.fr</strong></span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\\"><strong>17 Route d'Orange 84600 Valréas</strong></span><br>\\n</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<hr style=\\"display:inline-block;width:98%\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\">\\n<div id=\\"divRplyFwdMsg\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><font face=\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\" style=\\"font-size:11pt\\" color=\\"#000000\\"><b>De :</b> Caufriez Valentin &lt;v.caufriez@ebanista.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Envoyé :</b> mardi 15 septembre 2026 15:45:45<br>\\n<b>À :</b> Edward Boudon<br>\\n<b>Objet :</b> Demande d'offre – Catalogue Léman</font>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\nSalut Edward,</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\nJ'espère que tu vas bien.</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\nPourrais-tu s'il te plaît me faire parvenir une offre concernant les références suivantes du catalogue Léman :</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 1x 102.735.00 (en longueur 70 mm)</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 1x 257.703.01</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 2x 275.705.00</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 2x 275.705.01</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 1x 275.708.01</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\\">\\n- 2x 265