k links or open attachments unless you recognize the source of this email and know the content is safe.</font></center>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<hr>\\n</center>\\n<div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nBonjour Jeanne,</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nJe vais bien, merci. J'espère qu'il en est de même pour toi.</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nC'est bien noté pour la mise à jour des panneaux Virtuo au showroom de Maldegeme. Je prends en compte tes consignes pour les calepinages, notamment l'espace entre les trois coloris sur le panneau de 92 cm avec une pose en chevrons dans la hauteur.</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nJe te transmets le besoin en matière pour chaque référence:</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Kiruna clear 3 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Sakia Herring 4 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Kiruna beige 4 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Blomma dark 4 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Lumo honey 3 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Daintree amber 3 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Selva clear 3 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Sunny 5 lames&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Latina pallette 1 lame de chaque&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n- Seja grey et beige 1 lame de chaque&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div d